{"title":"Lab","slug":"Lab","hero":{"file":"Lab.webp","width":400,"height":174},"pageid":2252,"revid":19111,"timestamp":"2025-08-14T23:00:02Z","lastEditor":"PeridotGem","categories":["Locations"],"infobox":null,"sections":[],"body":"<p>The Lab is a location in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowy_Peaks/\">Snowy Peaks</a> associated with the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lab_Card/\">Lab Card</a> quest. \n</p><p>The Lab can be accessed from a cave entryway in the Peaks, near the Taiga entrance to the biome. Most of the lab is non-interactible, but the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Unknown_Person/\">Unknown Person</a> can be spoken to through a small grate in the wall, behind the broken glass. Speaking to them gives you the option to begin the quest.\n</p><p>There is an exit to the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/River_Caves/\">River Caves</a> through a nearby vent, however it is nearly impossible to get back up to it from the Caves, so do not use it unless you are certain your business is finished in the Lab. Amusingly, a poster of a kitten with the text \"BELIEVE\" over its head can be found in this area.\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0375697d5950656dc72dee5832475d34\" data-seq-no=\"0\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Lab-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/Lab.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Lab Room 1\">Lab Room 1</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Lab Room 1\">Lab Room 1</span></a></div></div><div>Lab Room 1</div></div><div><div><div id=\"Lab_went-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/Lab_went.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Lab vent\">Lab vent</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Lab vent\">Lab vent</span></a></div></div><div>Lab vent</div></div><div><div><div id=\"Lab_drop-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/Lab_drop.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Lab Room 2\">Lab Room 2</span></noscript><span role=\"img\